{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"For a balanced star connection, the phase voltage is the line voltage divided by √3 and the phase current is equal to the line current; in the delta, the phase voltage is equal to the line voltage and the phase current is the line current divided by √3.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"three-phase-power-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"fr","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"three-phase-power-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["three-phase-power-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"fr","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Pour un raccordement en étoile équilibré, la tension de phase est la tension de ligne divisée par √ZXQPH0000QXZ et le courant de phase est égal au courant de ligne. Dans le delta, la tension de phase est égale à la tension de ligne et le courant de phase est le courant de ligne divisé par √ZXQPH0001QXZ.","record_id":"1761ee4ab36a22d96cebe081b31d9a36985aef522aa7baca8dc2f3af1cc7dfad","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41185047487","seconds":1.4532874959999873,"source":"For a balanced star (wye) connection, phase voltage is line voltage divided by √3 and phase current equals line current. In delta, phase voltage equals line voltage and phase current is line current divided by √3. The total power for the same line values is the same.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"51fd30657f42038bc2531401370f6111d7fcc814d35875973551d3ef740f49ed","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Pour un raccordement en étoile équilibré, la tension de phase est la tension de ligne divisée par √3 et le courant de phase est égal au courant de ligne. Dans le delta, la tension de phase est égale à la tension de ligne et le courant de phase est le courant de ligne divisé par √3.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
